  "privacy_title": "Privacy Policy",
  "privacy_body": "Voxna Privacy Policy\n\nOperator: Sur Communication (general incorporated association)\nLast updated: November 3, 2026\n\n1. Information we handle\n- Voice data: your recordings. They are analyzed on the device and never sent to any server.\n- Anonymous sign-in: only the user ID created by Firebase Anonymous Authentication. We do not collect your name or email address.\n- App settings: theme, language, notification times and similar values, stored on the device.\n- Let go records: when and how many times you let go, the chips you chose, and an optional note (choose not to keep it and the text is not saved).\n- Chat history: what you typed in the Let go chat and the replies shown.\n- Let go settings: your words, goal count, check-in times and similar values.\n\n2. Let go chat and read-aloud\nThe chat only returns fixed replies chosen by rules on your device. It uses no AI and sends what you type nowhere. Read-aloud uses your device's speech engine. Notifications are also scheduled on the device.\n\n3. Where data is stored\nAll data stays on your device and is never transferred to an external server.\n\n4. Sharing with third parties\nWe never provide or sell your personal information or voice data to third parties.\n\n5. Deletion\nDelete account in Settings removes everything: recordings, history, settings, and your Let go records, chat history, Let go settings and scheduled notifications. Uninstalling the app also removes the data on the device.\n\n6. Contact\nSur Communication\nEmail: info@surc.online",

  "terms_title": "Terms of Service",
  "terms_body": "Voxna Terms of Service\n\nLast updated: January 1, 2025\n\n1. Service Overview\nVoxna is an application designed to deepen self-understanding through daily voice recording.\n\n2. Terms of Use\n- This app is intended for personal use\n- Copyright of recorded audio belongs to the user\n- Unauthorized use or modification of the app is prohibited\n\n3. Disclaimer\n- This app is not intended for medical diagnosis\n- Voice analysis results are for reference only\n- The developer is not liable for data loss\n\n4. Service Changes\nThe developer may change or terminate the service without prior notice.\n\n5. Governing Law\nThese terms are governed by the laws of Japan.",

